    "story_stages_json": "[{\"stage\": 1, \"title\": \"原初骨架：倍长中线构造全等中心对称\", \"titleZh\": \"原初骨架：倍长中线构造全等中心对称\", \"titleEn\": \"Original Skeleton: Doubling the Median to Construct Central Symmetry Congruence\", \"guide_text\": \"在 △ABC 中，AD 是 BC 边上的中线。将 AD 延长至 E 使 DE = AD，连接 CE，观察 △ABD 与 △ECD 的对应边与对顶角。\", \"guideTextZh\": \"在 △ABC 中，AD 是 BC 边上的中线。将 AD 延长至 E 使 DE = AD，连接 CE，观察 △ABD 与 △ECD 的对应边与对顶角。\", \"guideTextEn\": \"In △ABC, AD is the median to side BC. Extend AD to E such that DE = AD, and connect CE. Observe the corresponding sides and vertically opposite angles of △ABD and △ECD.\", \"teacher_secret\": \"几何转移的核心法门：中点 D 是天然的中心对称中心。倍长后利用 SAS（BD=CD, ∠ADB=∠EDC, AD=ED）把分散的边 AB 转移到 CE，与 AC 汇合于同一个三角形 △ACE 中。\", \"teacherSecretZh\": \"几何转移的核心法门：中点 D 是天然的中心对称中心。倍长后利用 SAS（BD=CD, ∠ADB=∠EDC, AD=ED）把分散的边 AB 转移到 CE，与 AC 汇合于同一个三角形 △ACE 中。\", \"teacherSecretEn\": \"The secret of geometric relocation: Midpoint D is a natural center of central symmetry. Doubling the median uses SAS (BD=CD, ∠ADB=∠EDC, AD=ED) to transfer separated side AB to CE, gathering it with AC into a single triangle △ACE.\", \"state_config\": {\"carrierId\": \"median_doubling_plane\", \"sliders\": {\"extend_ratio\": 1.0, \"vertex_ax\": -1.0, \"vertex_ay\": 5.0}, \"xrayActive\": false, \"activeDistractors\": []}}, {\"stage\": 2, \"title\": \"动态变异：钝角演变与三角形三边不等式\", \"titleZh\": \"动态变异：钝角演变与三角形三边不等式\", \"titleEn\": \"Dynamic Variation: Obtuse Evolution and Triangle Inequality\", \"guide_text\": \"拖动顶点 A 使 △ABC 变为钝角三角形，倍长中线延伸段 DE 仍严格保持等于 AD，新三角形 △ACE 的三边关系依然成立！\", \"guideTextZh\": \"拖动顶点 A 使 △ABC 变为钝角三角形，倍长中线延伸段 DE 仍严格保持等于 AD，新三角形 △ACE 的三边关系依然成立！\", \"guideTextEn\": \"Drag vertex A to transform △ABC into an obtuse triangle. The extended segment DE remains strictly equal to AD, and the triangle inequality in △ACE still holds!\", \"teacher_secret\": \"无论三角形形状如何畸变，CE 恒等于 AB，在中考中常用于求解中线 AD 的取值范围：|AB - AC| < 2AD < AB + AC。\", \"teacherSecretZh\": \"无论三角形形状如何畸变，CE 恒等于 AB，在中考中常用于求解中线 AD 的取值范围：|AB - AC| < 2AD < AB + AC。\", \"teacherSecretEn\": \"No matter how the triangle deforms, CE is identically equal to AB. In Zhongkao, this is frequently used to bound the median AD: |AB - AC| < 2AD < AB + AC.\", \"state_config\": {\"carrierId\": \"obtuse_median_doubling\", \"sliders\": {\"extend_ratio\": 1.0, \"vertex_ax\": 3.0, \"vertex_ay\": 3.5}, \"xrayActive\": false, \"activeDistractors\": []}}, {\"stage\": 3, \"title\": \"出题人伪装：外接多边形与杂乱连线遮蔽\", \"titleZh\": \"出题人伪装：外接多边形与杂乱连线遮蔽\", \"titleEn\": \"Examiner's Camouflage: Circumscribing Polygons and Cluttered Connecting Lines\", \"guide_text\": \"出题人在背景中加入复杂的平行四边形、梯形或外角连线，掩盖了 D 点是 BC 中线这一核心事实，让你根本想不到去“延长中线”。\", \"guideTextZh\": \"出题人在背景中加入复杂的平行四边形、梯形或外角连线，掩盖了 D 点是 BC 中线这一核心事实，让你根本想不到去“延长中线”。\", \"guideTextEn\": \"Examiners add complex parallelograms, trapezoids, or exterior angle lines to the background, concealing the critical fact that D is the midpoint of BC, thereby obscuring the idea of 'doubling the median'.\", \"teacher_secret\": \"出题人心理战：题目中给出中点 D 却不连中线，或者把 AD 隐没在四边形对角线中，阻断考生的辅助线联想。\", \"teacherSecretZh\": \"出题人心理战：题目中给出中点 D 却不连中线，或者把 AD 隐没在四边形对角线中，阻断考生的辅助线联想。\", \"teacherSecretEn\": \"Examiner's psychological tactic: Giving midpoint D without drawing the median, or submerging AD inside quadrilateral diagonals to interrupt the student's auxiliary line intuition.\", \"state_config\": {\"carrierId\": \"median_doubling_plane\", \"sliders\": {\"extend_ratio\": 1.0, \"vertex_ax\": -2.0, \"vertex_ay\": 6.0}, \"xrayActive\": false, \"activeDistractors\": [\"d1\"]}}, {\"stage\": 4, \"title\": \"[透视] 破案透视：中点照妖镜直击 △ABD ≌ △ECD\", \"titleZh\": \"[透视] 破案透视：中点照妖镜直击 △ABD ≌ △ECD\", \"titleEn\": \"[透视] X-Ray Insight: Midpoint Vision Unveiling △ABD ≌ △ECD\", \"guide_text\": \"开启透视照妖镜！杂乱干扰线全部虚化，中心对称全等 △ABD ≌ △ECD 瞬间点亮，边长与角平移一击即破！\", \"guideTextZh\": \"开启透视照妖镜！杂乱干扰线全部虚化，中心对称全等 △ABD ≌ △ECD 瞬间点亮，边长与角平移一击即破！\", \"guideTextEn\": \"Activate the X-Ray Insight! Cluttered distractor lines fade out, the centrally symmetric congruent pair △ABD ≌ △ECD illuminates instantly, and side and angle transfers crack open effortlessly!\", \"teacher_secret\": \"秒杀口诀：题中有中线，倍长中线试一试；分散线段难相见，拉到同个三角里！\", \"teacherSecretZh\": \"秒杀口诀：题中有中线，倍长中线试一试；分散线段难相见，拉到同个三角里！\", \"teacherSecretEn\": \"Instant-solve mantra: When a median appears, try doubling its length; when segments are scattered apart, pull them into the same triangle to unite their strength!\", \"state_config\": {\"carrierId\": \"median_doubling_plane\", \"sliders\": {\"extend_ratio\": 1.0, \"vertex_ax\": -2.0, \"vertex_ay\": 6.0}, \"xrayActive\": true, \"activeDistractors\": [\"d1\"]}}]"
