    "story_stages_json": "[{\"stage\": 1, \"title\": \"原初骨架：矩形折叠保距与设元建构\", \"titleZh\": \"原初骨架：矩形折叠保距与设元建构\", \"titleEn\": \"Original Skeleton: Rectangle Folding Invariance and Variable Formulation\", \"guide_text\": \"矩形 ABCD 沿折痕折叠，顶点 A 落在底边 BC 上的 A' 处。设 BE = y，则折叠保距得 A'E = AE = 8 - y，在 Rt△A'BE 中应用勾股定理。\", \"guideTextZh\": \"矩形 ABCD 沿折痕折叠，顶点 A 落在底边 BC 上的 A' 处。设 BE = y，则折叠保距得 A'E = AE = 8 - y，在 Rt△A'BE 中应用勾股定理。\", \"guideTextEn\": \"Rectangle ABCD is folded along a crease, placing vertex A at point A' on bottom edge BC. Let BE = y; by folding distance invariance, A'E = AE = 8 - y. Apply the Pythagorean theorem in Rt△A'BE.\", \"teacher_secret\": \"折叠的灵魂是轴对称保距保角：原线段与翻折线段长度严格相等。抓住未折部分构成的直角三角形，列出关于未知数的二次方程。\", \"teacherSecretZh\": \"折叠的灵魂是轴对称保距保角：原线段与翻折线段长度严格相等。抓住未折部分构成的直角三角形，列出关于未知数的二次方程。\", \"teacherSecretEn\": \"The essence of folding is axial symmetry preserving lengths and angles: original and folded segments are strictly equal in length. Focus on the right triangle formed by the unfolded boundary and formulate a quadratic equation in the unknown.\", \"state_config\": {\"carrierId\": \"rectangle_fold_pythagoras\", \"sliders\": {\"pos_fold\": 3.0, \"rect_w\": 8.0, \"rect_l\": 10.0}, \"xrayActive\": false, \"activeDistractors\": [], \"postureId\": \"standard\"}}, {\"stage\": 2, \"title\": \"动态变异：直角三角形翻折与方程变式\", \"titleZh\": \"动态变异：直角三角形翻折与方程变式\", \"titleEn\": \"Dynamic Variation: Right Triangle Folding and Equation Variations\", \"guide_text\": \"切换至直角三角形载体，沿过直角顶点的直线折叠使直角边落在斜边上，未知数向不同直角三角形转移。\", \"guideTextZh\": \"切换至直角三角形载体，沿过直角顶点的直线折叠使直角边落在斜边上，未知数向不同直角三角形转移。\", \"guideTextEn\": \"Switch to a right triangle carrier. Fold along a line through the right-angle vertex so a leg aligns onto the hypotenuse, transferring unknowns across adjacent right triangles.\", \"teacher_secret\": \"无论折叠载体是矩形还是三角形，解法范式完全一致：找直角三角形 -> 设未知数 x -> 用 x 表示三边 -> 勾股定理方程展开，二次项必对消降为一元一次方程！\", \"teacherSecretZh\": \"无论折叠载体是矩形还是三角形，解法范式完全一致：找直角三角形 -> 设未知数 x -> 用 x 表示三边 -> 勾股定理方程展开，二次项必对消降为一元一次方程！\", \"teacherSecretEn\": \"Whether folding a rectangle or a triangle, the paradigm is identical: locate a right triangle -> set variable x -> express all three sides in terms of x -> expand the Pythagorean equation; quadratic terms inevitably cancel down to a linear equation!\", \"state_config\": {\"carrierId\": \"right_triangle_fold\", \"sliders\": {\"pos_fold\": 2.5, \"rect_w\": 8.0, \"rect_l\": 12.0}, \"xrayActive\": false, \"activeDistractors\": [], \"postureId\": \"reflected\"}}, {\"stage\": 3, \"title\": \"出题人伪装：多层折痕网与二次动点复合\", \"titleZh\": \"出题人伪装：多层折痕网与二次动点复合\", \"titleEn\": \"Examiner's Camouflage: Multi-Layered Creases and Moving Point Compounds\", \"guide_text\": \"中考出题人会连续折叠两次（如先折角再折边），或引入动点 P 让折痕动态变化，背景充斥着虚线辅助线与折痕网。\", \"guideTextZh\": \"中考出题人会连续折叠两次（如先折角再折边），或引入动点 P 让折痕动态变化，背景充斥着虚线辅助线与折痕网。\", \"guideTextEn\": \"Examiners execute successive folds (such as folding a corner first then an edge) or introduce a moving point P to vary the crease, cluttering the background with dashed auxiliary lines and crease networks.\", \"teacher_secret\": \"压轴套路：出题人故意隐去落点 A' 的坐标，给出的条件是“重叠部分面积”，逼迫考生自行寻找勾股直角三角形。\", \"teacherSecretZh\": \"压轴套路：出题人故意隐去落点 A' 的坐标，给出的条件是“重叠部分面积”，逼迫考生自行寻找勾股直角三角形。\", \"teacherSecretEn\": \"Final problem trick: Examiners withhold the coordinates of folded landing point A' and instead give conditions like 'overlapping area', forcing candidates to unearth the hidden Pythagorean right triangle themselves.\", \"state_config\": {\"carrierId\": \"rectangle_fold_pythagoras\", \"sliders\": {\"pos_fold\": 3.5, \"rect_w\": 8.0, \"rect_l\": 10.0}, \"xrayActive\": false, \"activeDistractors\": [\"d1\"], \"postureId\": \"rot_90\"}}, {\"stage\": 4, \"title\": \"[透视] 破案透视：勾股照妖镜锁定核心方程\", \"titleZh\": \"[透视] 破案透视：勾股照妖镜锁定核心方程\", \"titleEn\": \"[透视] X-Ray Insight: Pythagorean Vision Locking the Core Equation\", \"guide_text\": \"开启透视照妖镜！干扰折痕虚化，核心 Rt△A'BE 高亮显影，方程 y² + x₀² = (8-y)² 代数闭环完全呈现，16y = 64 - x₀² 瞬间求解！\", \"guideTextZh\": \"开启透视照妖镜！干扰折痕虚化，核心 Rt△A'BE 高亮显影，方程 y² + x₀² = (8-y)² 代数闭环完全呈现，16y = 64 - x₀² 瞬间求解！\", \"guideTextEn\": \"Activate the X-Ray Insight! Distracting crease lines dim out, the pivotal Rt△A'BE highlights sharply, and the algebraic loop y² + x₀² = (8-y)² emerges, resolving 16y = 64 - x₀² instantly!\", \"teacher_secret\": \"秒杀口诀：折叠问题找直角，翻折对应等长找；设一为 x 表三边，勾股方程立功劳！\", \"teacherSecretZh\": \"秒杀口诀：折叠问题找直角，翻折对应等长找；设一为 x 表三边，勾股方程立功劳！\", \"teacherSecretEn\": \"Instant-solve mantra: In folding problems find the right angle, spot equal segments in the fold; let one side be x to express all three, and the Pythagorean equation solves it bold!\", \"state_config\": {\"carrierId\": \"rectangle_fold_pythagoras\", \"sliders\": {\"pos_fold\": 3.0, \"rect_w\": 8.0, \"rect_l\": 10.0}, \"xrayActive\": true, \"activeDistractors\": [\"d1\"], \"postureId\": \"standard\"}}]"
