    "story_stages_json": "[{\"stage\": 1, \"title\": \"原初骨架：双线交点与数形对应同解\", \"titleZh\": \"原初骨架：双线交点与数形对应同解\", \"titleEn\": \"Original Skeleton: Two-Line Intersection and Algebra-Geometry Equivalence\", \"guide_text\": \"绘制直线 L₁: y = 2x - 2 与 L₂: y = -x + 4。两直线交点 P(2, 2) 的横坐标 x=2 即为方程 2x - 2 = -x + 4 的精确解。\", \"guideTextZh\": \"绘制直线 L₁: y = 2x - 2 与 L₂: y = -x + 4。两直线交点 P(2, 2) 的横坐标 x=2 即为方程 2x - 2 = -x + 4 的精确解。\", \"guideTextEn\": \"Plot lines L₁: y = 2x - 2 and L₂: y = -x + 4. The x-coordinate x=2 of intersection point P(2, 2) is the exact solution to equation 2x - 2 = -x + 4.\", \"teacher_secret\": \"数形结合核心：方程的根就是函数图象交点的横坐标；二元一次方程组的解就是两条直线交点的坐标。\", \"teacherSecretZh\": \"数形结合核心：方程的根就是函数图象交点的横坐标；二元一次方程组的解就是两条直线交点的坐标。\", \"teacherSecretEn\": \"Core of combining number and shape: The root of an equation is the x-coordinate of the intersection of function graphs; the solution to a system of two linear equations is the coordinate pair of the two lines' intersection.\", \"state_config\": {\"carrierId\": \"linear_equation_inequality_plane\", \"sliders\": {\"slope_k1\": 2.0, \"intercept_b1\": -2.0, \"slope_k2\": -1.0, \"intercept_b2\": 4.0}, \"xrayActive\": false, \"activeDistractors\": []}}, {\"stage\": 2, \"title\": \"动态变异：以交点为界图象高低定不等式\", \"titleZh\": \"动态变异：以交点为界图象高低定不等式\", \"titleEn\": \"Dynamic Variation: Demarcating Inequalities by Graph Height Relative to Intersection\", \"guide_text\": \"观察不等式 y₁ > y₂ 的几何意义：寻找直线 L₁ 位于直线 L₂ 上方（更高）的区域，该区域对应的 x 范围即为不等式解集 x > 2。\", \"guideTextZh\": \"观察不等式 y₁ > y₂ 的几何意义：寻找直线 L₁ 位于直线 L₂ 上方（更高）的区域，该区域对应的 x 范围即为不等式解集 x > 2。\", \"guideTextEn\": \"Observe the geometric meaning of inequality y₁ > y₂: find the region where line L₁ lies above (higher than) line L₂; the corresponding x interval forms the solution set x > 2.\", \"teacher_secret\": \"一元一次不等式的图象解法：“谁大谁在上方”。以交点分界线为界，往左看或往右看，图象高低一目了然，无需繁复代数通分。\", \"teacherSecretZh\": \"一元一次不等式的图象解法：“谁大谁在上方”。以交点分界线为界，往左看或往右看，图象高低一目了然，无需繁复代数通分。\", \"teacherSecretEn\": \"Graphical method for linear inequalities: 'Whichever is greater lies higher up'. Using the intersection vertical line as boundary, look left or right: relative heights are crystal clear without cumbersome algebraic rearrangement.\", \"state_config\": {\"carrierId\": \"linear_equation_inequality_plane\", \"sliders\": {\"slope_k1\": 1.5, \"intercept_b1\": -1.0, \"slope_k2\": -0.5, \"intercept_b2\": 3.0}, \"xrayActive\": false, \"activeDistractors\": []}}, {\"stage\": 3, \"title\": \"出题人伪装：阴影半平面与平行无解陷阱\", \"titleZh\": \"出题人伪装：阴影半平面与平行无解陷阱\", \"titleEn\": \"Examiner's Camouflage: Shaded Half-Planes and Parallel No-Solution Traps\", \"guide_text\": \"中考出题人常引入平行移动（k₁=k₂）或半平面双重不等式约束，并用大面积半透明阴影遮蔽交点临界值。\", \"guideTextZh\": \"中考出题人常引入平行移动（k₁=k₂）或半平面双重不等式约束，并用大面积半透明阴影遮蔽交点临界值。\", \"guideTextEn\": \"Examiners often introduce parallel shifts (k₁=k₂) or dual half-plane inequality constraints, masking critical intersection coordinates behind large shaded regions.\", \"teacher_secret\": \"压轴易错点：出题人故意问“kx+b > mx+n 的解集”，但图象上不给解析式，只给交点坐标和零点，很多考生死算 k 和 b 导致时间耗尽。\", \"teacherSecretZh\": \"压轴易错点：出题人故意问“kx+b > mx+n 的解集”，但图象上不给解析式，只给交点坐标和零点，很多考生死算 k 和 b 导致时间耗尽。\", \"teacherSecretEn\": \"Common final problem trap: Asking for 'the solution set of kx+b > mx+n' without providing explicit equations—only intersection points and zeros. Students waste critical exam time trying to solve for k and b.\", \"state_config\": {\"carrierId\": \"parallel_shift_plane\", \"sliders\": {\"slope_k1\": 2.0, \"intercept_b1\": 1.0, \"slope_k2\": 2.0, \"intercept_b2\": -3.0}, \"xrayActive\": false, \"activeDistractors\": [\"d1\"]}}, {\"stage\": 4, \"title\": \"[透视] 破案透视：照妖镜秒读交点分界线\", \"titleZh\": \"[透视] 破案透视：照妖镜秒读交点分界线\", \"titleEn\": \"[透视] X-Ray Insight: Reading the Intersection Demarcation Line Instantly\", \"guide_text\": \"开启透视照妖镜！阴影干扰被穿透，垂直交点的分界准线 x = x₀ 自动投射，上方图象区间一览无遗，解集脱口而出！\", \"guideTextZh\": \"开启透视照妖镜！阴影干扰被穿透，垂直交点的分界准线 x = x₀ 自动投射，上方图象区间一览无遗，解集脱口而出！\", \"guideTextEn\": \"Activate the X-Ray Insight! Shading clutter is penetrated, vertical boundary line x = x₀ projects automatically through the intersection, the higher line interval is exposed, and the solution set is read off effortlessly!\", \"teacher_secret\": \"秒杀口诀：方程找交点，横坐就是解；不等看上下，高者解集列！\", \"teacherSecretZh\": \"秒杀口诀：方程找交点，横坐就是解；不等看上下，高者解集列！\", \"teacherSecretEn\": \"Instant-solve mantra: For equations find the intersection, its x-value is the solution true; for inequalities look high and low, the higher graph gives the range to you!\", \"state_config\": {\"carrierId\": \"linear_equation_inequality_plane\", \"sliders\": {\"slope_k1\": 2.0, \"intercept_b1\": -2.0, \"slope_k2\": -1.0, \"intercept_b2\": 4.0}, \"xrayActive\": true, \"activeDistractors\": [\"d1\"]}}]"
